'''Nature's Guardians: ELEMENTAL PIXIES''' (大精霊エレメンタルピクシーズ, ''Daiseirei Erementaru Pikushīzu'', '''Great Spirit Elemental Pixies''') is one of the Uber Rare Cat sets in [[The Battle Cats]] and [[Nyanko Daisensou]] added in the [[Version 6.5 Update]]. All Uber Rares in this set are anti-Alien and all include Barrier Breaker, Resist against Aliens, have relatively short recharge times, and one other [[Special Abilities|special ability]].

