==Trivia==
*Most of the Pixies correspond directly to a [[wikipedia:Pokémon|Pokémon]] [[bulbapedia:Type|type]]:
**[[Bora (Uber Rare Cat)|Bora]] corresponds to [[bulbapedia:Fire (type)|Fire]].
**[[Mizli (Uber Rare Cat)|Mizli]] corresponds to [[bulbapedia:Water (type)|Water]].
**[[Aer (Uber Rare Cat)|Aer]] corresponds to [[bulbapedia:Flying (type)|Flying]]. While Aer bears many similarities to the [[bulbapedia:Grass (type)|Grass]] type, Komori fits the role much better.
**[[Voli (Uber Rare Cat)|Voli]] corresponds to [[bulbapedia:Electric (type)|Electric]].
**[[Gravi (Uber Rare Cat)|Gravi]] corresponds to [[bulbapedia:Rock (type)|Rock]].
**[[Yamii (Uber Rare Cat)|Yamii]] corresponds to [[bulbapedia:Dark (type)|Dark]].
**[[Bliza (Uber Rare Cat)|Bliza]] corresponds to [[bulbapedia:Ice (type)|Ice]].
**[[Tekachi (Uber Rare Cat)|Tekachi]] corresponds to [[bulbapedia:Steel (type)|Steel]].
**[[Komori (Uber Rare Cat)|Komori]] corresponds to [[bulbapedia:Grass (type)|Grass]].
**[[Lumina (Legend Rare Cat)|Lumina]] corresponds to either [[bulbapedia:Fairy (type)|Fairy]] or [[bulbapedia:Psychic (type)|Psychic]].
*In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]]'s game files, there exists planned additions for this banner as well as the [[Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror (Gacha Event)|Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror]] banner, however, it is most likely a scrapped addition.

